      en: ["Means 'The Pots of Rubingo'.", "Linked to the legendary King Ruganzu II Ndoli.", "Legend says the pots were used to cook for his army.", "The site is located in Gatsibo District, Eastern Province.", "Archaeologists believe them to be natural rock formations.", "A site of strong cultural and mythological importance.", "An example of Rwanda's oral tradition."],
