      en: ["Now known as Gorilla Guardians Village.", "Founded to provide a livelihood for ex-poachers.", "Offers cultural experiences like traditional dance and music.", "Visitors can learn how to make banana beer.", "Located near Volcanoes National Park.", "Supports mountain gorilla conservation efforts.", "Showcases replicas of traditional royal residences."],
